        "original_id": "786b5b1e-ddab-5003-88f4-6d50de588078",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Slicked-up Pup, Tom and Jerry\n- People: William Hanna, Joseph Barbera, Fred Quimby\n- Topics: animated cartoons, short film series\n\nFacts:\n- In 1940, William Hanna and Joseph Barbera created Tom and Jerry as an American animated series of short films.\n- In 1951, Slicked-up Pup was released as an American one-reel animated cartoon.\n- Slicked-up Pup was the 60th Tom and Jerry cartoon directed by William Hanna and Joseph Barbera.\n- Fred Quimby produced Slicked-up Pup.",
